  nonce: 077e  # 077e
  message: "Priority consideration: Assembly files are rare in most repos but critical in OS kernels, bootloaders, and embedded projects. Consider starting with ELF-targeted x86-64 since that covers Linux kernel and most open-source assembly usage."  # 077e
